:: Xavier Hang Out End Early Low Fun [nobr]

/* Intro */

You stand next to <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Xavier</span> awkwardly as he continuously eyes you, as if he is waiting for whatever you have planned next. Unfortunately, you tell him that you have to go. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Really?”</span> He says, his tone falling and causing a shiver to run up your spine, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“So this was it then? Your big hang out plans?”</span> <span style="color:LightCoral">You nod nervously and he sighs, beginning to walk away.</span> <br>

