<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I have to say, I am pretty disappointed.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Xavier</span> says as he struts off, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I took you for a far more interesting person, but if this is the best you have to offer than I may have to think twice next time you ask to hang out.”</span> He turns back to you with a frown, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Next time, try harder.”</span> <span style="color:LightCoral">You feel a bit shaken by his words but turn around and begin to leave yourself.</span> <br>
