:: Xavier Hang Out End Early High Fun [nobr]

You stand nervously next to <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Xavier</span>, who eyes you with an amused smirk. He seems to be enjoying himself, though it is time for that to come to an end as you inform <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Xavier</span> that you have to leave. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Oh?”</span> He says with a hint of playfulness, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“And here I was trying to guess what our next activity would entail.”</span> He sighs, <span style="color:LightGreen">though the smile remains on his face.</span> <br>

