<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“But I guess it can’t be helped. Sad to see you go, but will enjoy watching you walk away, as they say.”</span> His smirk makes you blush a little, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I had an interesting time. I look forward to seeing what you come up with next. Just don’t make me wait too long for our next little playdate, hm?”</span> <span style="color:Pink">You nod and turn to walk away, feeling <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Xavier</span>’s eyes on you the entire time.</span> <br>
